{"unit_id": "tag:086N:proof", "translation": "由引理<REF_0001>，存在一个有限表示（finitely presented）的<MATH_0001>-模（module）<MATH_0002>和一个满射（surjection）<MATH_0003>。\n利用代数（algebra）结构，得到一个满射（surjection）\n<MATH_0004>\n记<MATH_0005>为核（kernel）。将<MATH_0006>写成一个滤过余极限（filtered colimit），其中各项为有限型（finite type）<MATH_0007>-子模（submodules）<MATH_0008>（引理<REF_0002>）。设\n<MATH_0009>\n其中<MATH_0010>表示一个理想（ideal）层（sheaf），由<MATH_0011>的像（image）生成。\n于是每个<MATH_0012>都是有限表示（finitely presented）的<MATH_0013>-代数（algebra），过渡映射（transition maps）都是满射（surjections），且<MATH_0014>。为完成证明，还须证明<MATH_0015>是有限（finite）<MATH_0016>-代数（algebra），只要<MATH_0017>充分大（large）。为此，选取一个仿射开（affine open）覆盖（covering）<MATH_0018>。取生成元（generators）\n<MATH_0019>。\n由于<MATH_0020>是有限（finite）<MATH_0021>-代数（algebra），对每个<MATH_0022>，都存在首一多项式（monic polynomial）<MATH_0023>，使得<MATH_0024>在<MATH_0025>中为零（zero）。由构造可知<MATH_0026>，因此<MATH_0027>在<MATH_0028>中成立，只要<MATH_0029>充分大（large）。对这样的<MATH_0030>，代数（algebras）<MATH_0031>是有限（finite）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "surjection", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "kernel", "target_term": "核"}, {"source_term": "filtered colimit", "target_term": "滤过余极限"}, {"source_term": "finite type", "target_term": "有限型"}, {"source_term": "submodules", "target_term": "子模"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "finitely presented", "target_term": "有限表示"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "transition maps", "target_term": "过渡映射"}, {"source_term": "surjections", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "finite", "target_term": "有限"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "large", "target_term": "大"}, {"source_term": "affi